WEBVTT

cap_01
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.685
Why does your

cap_02
00:00:00.685 --> 00:00:01.788
phone drop to

cap_03
00:00:01.788 --> 00:00:04.110
one percent outside?

cap_04
00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:04.923
The battery hasn't

cap_05
00:00:04.923 --> 00:00:06.118
suddenly emptied.

cap_06
00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:07.488
Cold slows the chemistry

cap_07
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:08.916
that moves charge, so

cap_08
00:00:08.916 --> 00:00:10.321
the phone estimates less

cap_09
00:00:10.321 --> 00:00:11.610
power is available.

cap_10
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.293
Here's the useful test:

cap_11
00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:14.292
bring it inside and

cap_12
00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.871
let it warm naturally.

cap_13
00:00:15.871 --> 00:00:17.136
This tiny lab screen

cap_14
00:00:17.136 --> 00:00:18.611
tracks the estimate, not

cap_15
00:00:18.611 --> 00:00:20.329
the true stored energy.

cap_16
00:00:20.329 --> 00:00:21.478
Sidekick, please stop

cap_17
00:00:21.478 --> 00:00:22.035
trying to plug

cap_18
00:00:22.035 --> 00:00:23.000
in the sun.
